  "summary": "Cell C5 loads the region day by day, builds per-day-of-year pools using tm_yday (which shifts non-leap years by one day after February), computes per-cell hazen 90th-percentile thresholds, and smooths them with a 31-day wrap. It then compares all 2016-06-01..08-31 target SST to the smoothed thresholds for days of year 153-244, so it needs pools for days 138-259. Every sea cell's own values flow into the saved mask."
